# Keqing Chevreuse Fischl Bennett. ~16s Rot. Electro Keqing Overload. Keqing does skill & burst sandwiched by Bennett skills for Chev RES Shred uptime, then triggers the stilleto and does 5N1C. C6 Bennett is a DPS Gain.

# Team- Options listsed by DPS
keqing char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
keqing add weapon="finale" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
